WEBVTT

00:15:31.299 --> 00:15:33.802
So, the TED Prize.

00:15:33.802 --> 00:15:36.779
When I first heard from TED
and Chris a few months ago

00:15:36.779 --> 00:15:40.615
about the possibility of the Prize,
I was completely floored.

00:15:40.615 --> 00:15:44.186
They asked me to come up
with a very brief wish for humanity,

00:15:44.186 --> 00:15:45.950
no more than 50 words.

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:48.694
So I thought about it,
I wrote my 50 words,

00:15:48.694 --> 00:15:53.381
and a few weeks later,
Chris called and said, "Go for it."

00:15:53.381 --> 00:15:56.329
So here is my wish:

00:15:56.329 --> 00:15:59.278
that you will help us

00:15:59.278 --> 00:16:02.018
take everything we've learned
through StoryCorps